// - Multiresolution, as Blender's Multiresolution modifier and ZBrush's
//   subdivision levels: 'Multires', a base and n Catmull-Clark levels, each
//   level's detail stored as displacements from the level below in the tangent
//   frame of its smooth reference surface, so detail rides along when a lower
//   level is reshaped or posed; 'addLevel' (Subdivide/Divide), 'fromDense'
//   (Reconstruct Subdiv: unsubdivide, then a least squares fit of each lower
