// their boxes' centres along the axis those centres spread most (ties by
// item number), so the same boxes always give the same tree. A query
// answers every item whose box meets a given box, edges and corners
// touching included: boxes are compared exactly, so nothing that touches is
// missed, and what a query answers does not depend on the tree's shape.

